<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443793669"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:14.920"><div begin="25.102" end="49.951" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="25.102" end="30.701" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.102" end="26.066">若你想</span><span begin="26.066" end="26.584">问</span><span begin="26.584" end="27.648">我</span> <span begin="28.484" end="29.008">不</span><span begin="29.008" end="29.351">会</span><span begin="29.351" end="30.082">否</span><span begin="30.082" end="30.701">认</span></p><p begin="31.762" end="37.150" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.762" end="32.656">只有你</span><span begin="32.656" end="33.193">可</span><span begin="33.193" end="33.823">以</span><span begin="33.838" end="34.308">令我</span><span begin="34.308" end="34.936">生</span><span begin="34.936" end="35.383">命</span><span begin="35.459" end="36.051">再有</span><span begin="36.051" end="36.574">热</span><span begin="36.574" end="37.150">情</span></p><p begin="38.302" end="44.557" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.302" end="39.073">心</span><span begin="39.073" end="39.387">不</span><span begin="39.387" end="39.930">知</span><span begin="39.930" end="40.490">醉</span><span begin="40.490" end="40.874">或</span><span begin="40.874" end="44.557">醒</span></p><p begin="45.143" end="49.951" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.143" end="45.974">但这份</span><span begin="45.974" end="46.487">痴</span><span begin="46.487" end="47.142">心</span> <span begin="47.184" end="47.675">唯独</span><span begin="47.675" end="48.165">你</span><span begin="48.165" end="48.490">是</span><span begin="48.490" end="49.112">看</span><span begin="49.112" end="49.404">不</span><span begin="49.404" end="49.951">明</span></p></div><div begin="50.054" end="1:16.735" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="50.054" end="56.932" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.054" end="50.997">常在暗</span><span begin="50.997" end="51.594">恋</span><span begin="51.594" end="51.834">你</span><span begin="51.834" end="52.372">想</span><span begin="52.372" end="52.678">你</span><span begin="52.678" end="53.266">等你</span> <span begin="53.266" end="54.286">我的眼神</span><span begin="54.286" end="55.384">泛滥</span><span begin="55.384" end="55.729">着</span><span begin="55.729" end="56.326">爱</span><span begin="56.326" end="56.932">情</span></p><p begin="57.027" end="1:03.389" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.027" end="57.654">能令</span><span begin="57.654" end="58.477">天知道</span><span begin="58.477" end="59.335">她知道</span><span begin="59.335" end="1:00.185">应知道</span><span begin="1:00.185" end="1:00.998">都知道</span> <span begin="1:00.998" end="1:01.571">偏</span><span begin="1:01.571" end="1:02.190">偏</span><span begin="1:02.190" end="1:02.727">你未</span><span begin="1:02.727" end="1:03.389">知</span></p><p begin="1:03.389" end="1:10.097" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.389" end="1:04.342">然后看</span><span begin="1:04.342" end="1:04.919">秋</span><span begin="1:04.919" end="1:05.203">去</span><span begin="1:05.203" end="1:05.705">冬</span><span begin="1:05.705" end="1:05.972">去</span><span begin="1:05.972" end="1:06.567">春去</span> <span begin="1:06.567" end="1:07.699">始终两人</span><span begin="1:07.699" end="1:08.251">未</span><span begin="1:08.251" end="1:08.802">是</span><span begin="1:08.802" end="1:09.304">爱</span><span begin="1:09.304" end="1:10.097">侣</span></p><p begin="1:10.400" end="1:16.735" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.400" end="1:10.961">无论</span><span begin="1:10.961" end="1:11.860">真知道</span><span begin="1:11.860" end="1:12.660">不知道</span><span begin="1:12.660" end="1:13.435">只知道</span><span begin="1:13.435" end="1:13.915">是</span><span begin="1:13.915" end="1:14.511">我</span><span begin="1:14.511" end="1:15.090">心</span><span begin="1:15.090" end="1:16.735">碎</span></p></div><div begin="1:18.366" end="1:43.292" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:18.366" end="1:24.190" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.366" end="1:19.39